                 Copyright 2026 Wu
                 A memory-focused fork of Zed, licensed under
                 GPL-3.0-or-later with Apache-2.0 components.

  WuIDE (this fork)
                 Modifications made on top of Wu: the product is renamed, the
                 built-in agent list changed, a generic ACP driver and bundled
                 DeepSeek and Pi agent runtimes were added, agent processes are
                 started on demand instead of staying resident, and the icons
                 were replaced. See FORK.md for the complete list.

